Brigadeiro Tradicional para Equacoes Quimicas.

This recipe balances chemical equations while cooking a delicious Brazilian brigadeiro.

Ingredients.
1 g reactants
1 g products
66 ml B
114 ml r
105 ml i
103 ml g
97 ml a
100 ml d
101 ml e
111 ml o
32 ml space
112 ml p
102 ml f
116 ml t
33 ml exclamation

Method.
Take reactants from refrigerator.
Take products from refrigerator.
Put reactants into the mixing bowl.
Remove products from the mixing bowl.
Put exclamation into the mixing bowl.
Put o into the mixing bowl.
Put t into the mixing bowl.
Put i into the mixing bowl.
Put e into the mixing bowl.
Put f into the mixing bowl.
Put r into the mixing bowl.
Put e into the mixing bowl.
Put p into the mixing bowl.
Put space into the mixing bowl.
Put o into the mixing bowl.
Put r into the mixing bowl.
Put i into the mixing bowl.
Put e into the mixing bowl.
Put d into the mixing bowl.
Put a into the mixing bowl.
Put g into the mixing bowl.
Put i into the mixing bowl.
Put r into the mixing bowl.
Put B into the mixing bowl.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
